lines+=['','Full author lists, reading status and PDF links: [papers/README.md](papers/README.md). Version bytes/pages/SHA256: [notes/papers_manifest.json](notes/papers_manifest.json). Years primarily indicate first submission; conference/revision years can differ. Chunk PDFs are not counted as separate papers.','', '| Specified web article | Local archive | Use |','|---|---|---|','| [Modifying beliefs via SDF](https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/modifying-beliefs-via-sdf/) | notes/sdf.html and .txt | Document diversity, controls, June2025 correction |','| [Believe It or Not](https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/believe-it-or-not/) | notes/believe.html and .txt | Generality/robustness/representations |','| [False-facts experiments](https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/CdymgH4MQdFgB6Fg7/what-happens-when-you-train-models-on-false-facts-1) | notes/false_facts.html and .txt | Probe confounds; exploratory evidence |','', '## Data','', '| Resource | Source and local path | Size / splits | Role |','|---|---|---|---|','| CounterFact | [azhx/counterfact](https://huggingface.co/datasets/azhx/counterfact); datasets/counterfact/ | 21,919 records; train19,728/test2,191;12.39MB | Mandated factual locality control |','| GSM8K | [official source](https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math); datasets/gsm8k/ | Test1,319;0.75MB JSONL | Math capability, not uniformly unrelated |','| WikiText-2 raw | [Salesforce/wikitext](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Salesforce/wikitext); datasets/wikitext2/ | Train36,718/dev3,760/test4,358;7.75MB parquet | Replay, NLL and KL controls |','| RippleEdits | [official release](https://github.com/edenbiran/RippleEdits); datasets/ripple_edits/ | Popular885/random1,922/recent1,948 =4,755;42.40MB | Conditional dependency/preservation design |','| Arithmetic isolation (generated) | scripts/build_arithmetic_suite.py; datasets/arithmetic_isolation/ | Train405/dev115/test1,879 =2,399;0.74MB JSONL | Main hypothesis-specific pilot suite |','', 'All row counts are locally measured. Blank WikiText rows are retained and counted separately. Schemas, provenance, licenses, loading and exact download commands: [datasets/README.md](datasets/README.md). Small actual samples are tracked; raw data are Git-ignored. CounterFact license is unspecified in the hosted card. Arithmetic suite semantics are explicit and not a globally coherent replacement for arithmetic.','', '## Code','', '| Repository | Pinned commit | Local path | Purpose |','|---|---|---|---|']
purpose={'model-editing-ft':'Single-edit loss/trainer and replay','RippleEdits':'Conditional ripple evaluation and benchmark','rome':'Rank-one baseline and CounterFact evaluator','AlphaEdit':'Null-space preservation comparator','false-facts':'Original SDF data/training/evaluation','believe-it-or-not':'Generality, robustness and belief-depth pipeline'}
for x in repos:lines.append(f"| [{x['name']}]({x['url']}) | `{x['commit']}` | {x['path']}/ | {purpose[x['name']]} |")
lines+=['','Readmes/dependencies/entrypoints inspected; no heavy packages, models, submodules or paid APIs installed/run. [code/README.md](code/README.md) describes version conflicts, GPU requirements, licenses and adaptation points. Clones preserve upstream embedded files; experiment-ready datasets are separated under datasets/.','', '## Search and selection','', 'Paper-finder diligent search was used first, after installing its missing httpx dependency in the fresh uv environment. Search terms covered knowledge-editing locality, counterfactual arithmetic, ripple effects, belief adoption, SDF and arithmetic mechanisms. Full output: paper_search.json; per-attempt results: notes/search_downloads.jsonl and notes/search_downloads_retry.jsonl. ArXiv/official paper pages, Semantic Scholar, GitHub and Hugging Face supplemented the search; broad web queries also checked Scholar/Papers with Code. No private dataset or Kaggle credential was needed.','', 'Every returned candidate received a download attempt; failed Semantic Scholar retrievals were retried through arXiv title matching. Rate limiting (429), gateway/API failures and unmatched titles prevented196 supplementary entries from resolving to local PDFs. [notes/search_access.csv](notes/search_access.csv) reconciles failures against PDFs already downloaded independently. Missing abstracts were screened by title; the acquired SSS abstract was read from its first PDF page. This is a structured resource search, not a registered systematic review or exhaustive current-SOTA claim.','', 'All eight user-specified arXiv PDFs were deep-read using three-page chunks; all chunks, including appendices, were visually inspected. The highest-ranked Shattering paper also received complete chunk review. The three specified web articles were fully read. The linked90-page Believe paper was main-text reviewed only. [notes/chunk_reading_log.md](notes/chunk_reading_log.md) preserves immediate notes. Broader downloaded papers were screened, not uniformly deep-read.','', '## Experiment handoff','', 'The evidence-weighted ranking and rejected directions are fixed in [planning.md](planning.md): (1) preservation-constrained parametric editing; (2) exact and semantic routing boundaries; (3) training breadth versus depth of adoption. These share one frozen evaluation suite. Additional papers do not expand the implementation search space.','', 'Start by checking model/tokenizer revisions, hardware/access and base arithmetic competence; then cache base outputs/logits. Adapt the single-edit FT loss first, include unchanged/sham/true-fact controls, and compare methods at matched efficacy using dev-selected hyperparameters. Keep exact-string routing labeled as a wrapper control. Use repeated seeds and family-aware uncertainty. Report desired semantic propagation separately from harmful preservation failures.','', 'Primary measures: exact efficacy, paraphrase transfer, near/far/operator agreement and accuracy, paired downstream ordinary/edited-rule agreement, unrelated factual/math behavior, full-distribution KL and held-out NLL, answer5 bias, parameter change and latency. Numeric AST oracles and lexical samples are ready; broad SDF corpora are intentionally not generated in resource gathering and require a matched-token generation protocol in direction3.','', '## Reproducibility and limitations','', 'Fresh .venv, pyproject.toml and uv.lock isolate resource dependencies. Run `uv sync`, followed by dataset/repository scripts documented above. No conda or ambient research environment was used. All original PDFs parse; data hashes/row counts and git exclusions are verified in notes/resource_validation.json. Model weights, covariance matrices and large synthetic-document corpora are not downloaded; full published-scale replications therefore remain outside the ready-to-run resource set. The generated benchmark is deterministic but small/templated in semantic strata. Neither zero observed leakage nor a changed probe establishes universal isolation or genuine belief.','', 'Pipeline state is preserved in STATE.md; only the resource_finder-owned notes are updated. Completion is signaled by .resource_finder_complete after final validation.']
(R/'resources.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
